<title>NETHERLANDS: FUGRO DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>FUGRO DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch engineering consultancy Fugro said on Friday it had set its 1996 alternative stock dividend at one new share per 31 held.</p>
<p>In March, Fugro announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 1.50 guilders, up from 0.70 the previous year.</p>
<p>Fugro shares closed at 45.80 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
